1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:02,630
(Mrs Latham:)Oh, I made you uncomfortable
last night.

2
00:00:02,630 --> 00:00:04,470
(Mrs Latham:)I'm so sorry.

3
00:00:04,470 --> 00:00:05,770
(Leonard:)No, that's okay.

4
00:00:05,770 --> 00:00:07,700
(Mrs Latham:)No, it most
certainly is not.

5
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:09,940
(Mrs Latham:)Leonard, I'm making the
donation to your department

6
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:12,240
(Mrs Latham:)regardless of what
happens between us.

7
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:14,310
- Really?
- Well, of course.

8
00:00:14,310 --> 00:00:16,180
(Mrs Latham:)There's no quid
pro quo here.

9
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:18,180
(Mrs Latham:)You and your colleagues are
doing remarkable research,

10
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:19,910
(Mrs Latham:)and you deserve the money.

11
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:21,620
(Leonard:)Oh.

12
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:24,050
(Leonard:)Then what was
last night about?

13
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:27,150
I took a shot; sue me.

14
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:29,660
(Leonard:)Oh.

15
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:31,560
(Mrs Latham:)You're a very
handsome man, Leonard.

16
00:00:32,990 --> 00:00:35,130
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

17
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:38,430
(Mrs Latham:)It was foolish of me to
think someone your age

18
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:41,000
(Mrs Latham:)might ever be interested
in someone like me.

19
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,330
(Leonard:)Oh, don't say that.

20
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:44,200
(Leonard:)- You're a very attractive woman.
- Oh, please.

21
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:47,170
- No, it's true.
- Well, aren't you sweet.

22
00:00:47,170 --> 00:00:49,480
(Mrs Latham:)Just for the record...

23
00:00:49,480 --> 00:00:52,980
(Mrs Latham:)you'd remember a night with me
for the rest of your life.

24
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:58,080
(Leonard:)I'm sure I would.

